**Privacy Policy for Brain Garden**

Brain Garden respects your privacy.  
This app does not collect personally identifiable information.  
However, it may use third-party services such as Google AdMob that collect information used to identify you for advertising purposes.

**Data Collection**
- Google AdMob may collect data such as device information, advertising ID, and usage data to provide personalized ads.
- We do not store or share any personal information ourselves.

**User Consent**
Users located in the European Economic Area (EEA) will be presented with a consent form in compliance with the GDPR.  
Users may withdraw their consent at any time through the consent management form in the app.

